OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy
OL,6,Fthundery showers will continue to
OL,7,Fclear southwards this evening, though
OL,8,Fsome may linger into the night towards
OL,9,Fthe Kent coast. Clearer skies will
OL,10,Fbring a rather cool night, especially
OL,11,Fin rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,14,Fpossible in the far east, otherwise a
OL,15,Fdry and bright day on Saturday with
OL,16,Fspells of sunshine. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
